{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:72ca28b32dc5927e46a2ed64f30d5b58c94da9e8dbcdc72015105fd249a7ee63",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c34b98c2b97d8009bd859feff16191627d10dfff6117e0c6682af42d7ed54641",
      "text": "啊……喂，是我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f04ae388464ead9fcdb94b4a9a5fb9796ce565e8a7c51ff1410c6368ca5432b0",
      "text": "拍摄结束后一阵手忙脚乱，都没能好好聊聊，\n所以我打个电话过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9e4675d27b23d5e0c92c41e26daa420a1c665f9f00506374f268f87f4b81046",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我们的演出怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c280090dc25e212a256ffc37132ea9b160cbae6b0afbbee127e6fababdd45e8",
      "text": "太精彩了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:307775e80d00aeebdcf0d5dd0ba94212fede3d7724d598b50cea876def912fbe",
      "text": "……看休息室里那些人的反应我就知道了，\n不过还是姑且问你一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68a62c158f83b0331fb6f42cdde5fc155400383922fcf0f75817fcc3e0310b9c",
      "text": "行业里的人，也见识到我们的厉害之处了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03ccc8d002805cd0c22a322be261b9d23b992375089fc07fe8bda888cb87774c",
      "text": "超过1000分！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4708307d374dea2c0be8104ed44e4c707c8b09b58eefcd08a2d2ffebcb20f681",
      "text": "对吧？等那段录像公开之后，\n我们的粉丝肯定会一口气暴涨的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e42cd4189eda6008ae7dcdb98a0d41f001e7cf0331a218ffc4bf23ecb53132cb",
      "text": "从那之后，知名度会越来越高，\n让全世界都知道C.FIRST的大名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0bff67f7320a25f1ab2fee4114792d9d082fa0b134888f7ce59b1a54b36fe8f",
      "text": "虽然今天的演出让我们离目标又近了一步，\n但直到改变世界的那天为止，我们绝不会停下脚步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_302_2_3_047_02_09_a:2_3_047_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa36ac635a32d014e684726fbc25292d5221753e374a84bb86ca18ce2a44878",
      "text": "……为此，也少不了你的助力。\n以后也拜托了。那就事务所见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
